get.description:
Lists your project's payment links, newest first, a page at a time. A
canceled link is never listed; retrieve it by id. The filters combine;
send a cursor with the same filters as the page that issued it.

merchant.payment.v1.PaymentMethod.description:
PaymentMethod is how an attempt is paid. `type` names the method;
exactly the sub-object of that name is set when it has one, every other
one is `null`.
